abstract: Between 2022 and 2023, a number of multibeam surveys were performed in the
  Fraser River in order to characterize the riverbed. Of particular interest was the
  morphology of canyon walls along the river. The collected data were then used to
  assess landslide risk along the river, and to select areas where repeat surveys
  / monitoring could be done.
